  "title": "Biohaven's Phase 2 Obesity Study with Taldefgrobep Alfa, a Novel Myostatin-Activin Pathway Inhibitor, Completes Enrollment",
  "summary": "Phase 2 study in obesity, evaluating treatment with once-weekly and once-monthly taldefgrobep alfa as monotherapy, is now fully enrolled; topline data expected in 2H 2026. Taldefgrobep is a novel inhibitor of the myostatin-activin signaling pathway, which directly targets both fat and muscle,",
